# Clone Home -- rename map (input to tools/rename_ch.py).
# Old (obfuscated) names on the left, new names on the right. Only members whose
# role was confirmed from call sites are renamed; see docs/CLASS_MAP.md for the
# evidence and for what is still unknown. Anything not listed keeps its name.
#
#   class  <old> <New>
#   field  <oldClass>.<oldField> <newName>
#   method <oldClass>.<oldMethod>(<paramTypes>) <newName>

